.TH GETGROUPS 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
getgroups \- reads supplementary groups
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int getgroups(int count, gid_t* groups);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads supplementary groups. A zero count queries the required number without writing the array.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR getgroups (2)
